OL,3,GNEWSARNLI video receives 'pure hatred'
OL,4,Aafter anti-migrant protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who shared an RNLI video on
OL,7,Fsocial media says she has received
OL,8,F"pure hatred" following anti-migrant
OL,9,Fprotests in England.
OL,11,FCouncillor Elizabeth Evans, who
OL,12,Frepresents Aberaeron and Aberarth in
OL,13,FCeredigion, shared a video on Facebook
OL,14,Fwhich showed New Quay's RNLI lifeboat
OL,15,Fleaving the station on a training day.
OL,17,FAccording to Evans, the post - which
OL,18,Fattracted 30,000 views - drew comments
OL,19,Fof hatred, some of which she described
OL,20,Fas "really, really bad".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
