OL,3,GNEWSARNLI video receives 'pure hatred'
OL,4,Aafter anti-migrant protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after RNLI volunteers in
OL,7,FPortsmouth were targeted by protesters
OL,8,Ffollowing the charity's role in helping
OL,9,Fto bring migrants on a small boat to
OL,10,Fshore earlier this month.
